-- הסכם קיבוצי — שכר ותנאי עבודה של עובדי ההוראה בחטיבות העליונות לשנים
-- 2017–2022 (14.3.2018): the agreement between the local authorities (the
-- Centre of Local Government, the three large cities and the Centre of
-- Regional Councils) and ארגון המורים, as the corpus holds it: the final
-- text of 14.3.2018, faxed by the union that evening, its day of signing and
-- the director-general's notice in §24 left blank. It amends the merger
-- agreement of 5.9.2017, which had lowered the pay of teachers outside the
-- Oz LaTmura reform and of principals: new combined-salary tables (§4 and
-- annexes א'–ד'), shekel supplements (§5), the merger supplement (§6), the
-- 87 transition supplement (§8), carrying it out (§11), a one-time grant
-- (§17) and more; then the managers' budget (§18), the union's funds
-- (§§19–22), the agreement of 26.6.2014 extended (§23), the strike days made
-- up (§24), disputes void, exhaustion and industrial peace to 28.2.2022
-- (§§25–27), and one arrangement (§28).
--
-- Circular תשע"ח/3 publishes the agreement for the owners' high schools,
-- §§2–17 row for row, and its rules were encoded there first
-- (l4/circulars/2017-18_tashach_03.l4). So each row the two print in the
-- same words is cited "as in circular תשע"ח/3", by the rule that encodes it
-- there, and this file imports the circular; a row the circular prints with
-- other words says what differs (the circular numbers two more paragraphs
-- in §4, so this agreement's §§4.2–4.3 are its §§4.3–4.5). What the circular
-- leaves out is encoded here: the preamble and §1, §§18–28, and the four
-- annexed tables, which the circular names and does not print.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `2017-18_tashach_03`
IMPORT minimum_wage_law
IMPORT wage_protection_law

§ `הסכם קיבוצי מיום 14.3.2018 — שכר ותנאי עבודה בחטיבות העליונות, 2017–2022`

