-- Against the Minimum Wage Law's floor (MMS-601): §6 (the merger
-- agreement's new 5א(ה)) and §17(ט) are the circular's word for word, and
-- so are their rules: the merger supplement and the one-time grant are left
-- out of the pay that counts toward the top-up, which makes the top-up the
-- law's or more (its §11). Checked on a month's figures as if §3 counted
-- each (a fixed supplement for the work), the strictest case.
#ASSERT NOT `counting a component as the instrument does falls below the Minimum Wage Law` 5300 4800 (`component paid in the month under the Minimum Wage Law` `a fixed supplement paid for the work, under section 3(ב)(3)` 300) (`the merger supplement counts for` `topping up to the minimum wage`)
#ASSERT NOT `counting a component as the instrument does falls below the Minimum Wage Law` 5300 4800 (`component paid in the month under the Minimum Wage Law` `a fixed supplement paid for the work, under section 3(ב)(3)` 300) (`the grant counts for` `topping up to the minimum wage`)

-- Against the Wage Protection Law (MMS-601): §11.5 is the circular's word
-- for word: up to the salary of August 2018 an overpayment made by an error
-- in carrying out the agreement is an advance on wages for §25(א)(7), and
-- §11.6 deducts it in twelve equal parts — within §25 for any overpayment
-- up to three months' wages, the section's own cap carrying the rest.
#ASSERT `the overpayment counts as an advance on wages` 12 TRUE
#ASSERT `section 25 of the Wage Protection Law permits the deduction` `an advance on account of wages`
#ASSERT `equal monthly parts of the advance stay within section 25` 30000 10000 12

DECLARE `action of 14.3.2018` IS ONE OF
    `agree the managers' budget in a collective agreement by 1.4.2018`
    `allocate the managers' budget`
    `declare a labour dispute or take organisational measures over the managers' budget`
    `transfer the yearly sum to the union's fund`
    `make up the school days the strike lost`
    `negotiate further economic demands to 28.2.2022`
    `strike, lock out or disrupt work over what the agreement of 14.3.2018 settles`

§§ `18 תקציב לשכר המנהלים`

-- (א): a budget to raise the managers' pay, its allocation to be agreed and
-- set in a collective agreement by 1.4.2018: (1) 10 million shekels for
-- תשע"ט (from 1.9.2018); (2) 20 million a school year from תש"פ (from
-- 1.9.2019). The sums are the cost of the allocation, not what any one
-- manager is paid.
@ref akn:art_18__para_a akn:art_18__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_18__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the managers' budget of 14.3.2018 for the year from` d IS
    BRANCH IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) THEN 20000000
           IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2018) THEN 10000000
           OTHERWISE 0

`the managers' budget's agreement is due by` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2018

-- (ב): if no such agreement is signed by 1.4.2018, the budget goes to the
-- "87 transition supplement": from 1.9.2018 it rises by 460 shekels to
-- 548.52, and from 1.9.2019 by 460 more to 1,008.52, its other rules
-- unchanged, and no further negotiation is held on the cost.
@ref akn:art_18__para_b akn:art_18__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_18__para_b__subpara_2
GIVEN `an agreement on the managers' budget was signed by 1.4.2018` IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the 87 transition supplement under §18(ב)` `an agreement on the managers' budget was signed by 1.4.2018` d IS
    IF `an agreement on the managers' budget was signed by 1.4.2018`
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE BRANCH IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) THEN JUST 1008.52
                IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2018) THEN JUST 548.52
                OTHERWISE NOTHING

#ASSERT 548.52 PLUS 460 EQUALS 1008.52
#ASSERT `the 87 transition supplement under §18(ב)` FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) EQUALS JUST 1008.52

-- (ג): this takes nothing from §27's industrial peace, and no dispute is
-- declared nor measures taken for want of agreement on the allocation.
@ref akn:art_18__para_c
`no dispute over the managers' budget` MEANS
    PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
    SHANT `declare a labour dispute or take organisational measures over the managers' budget`

§§ `19–22 קרנות ארגון המורים`

-- §19: to the union's distress fund, a further 4 million shekels over
-- 2018–2021, a million each year by December. §20: the same to the loans
-- fund set up under §יב of the agreement of 12.9.95. §21: by §19 of the
-- agreement of 10.9.2003 it is renewed, so that the sick-days fund set up by
-- the agreement of 25.6.1995 resumes, its §§4–19 applying; the same 4
-- million over 2018–2021 funds it.
@ref akn:art_19/p1 akn:art_20/p1 akn:art_21/p1
`the yearly sum to each of the funds of §§19–21` MEANS 1000000
`the years of §§19–21` MEANS LIST 2018, 2019, 2020, 2021

#ASSERT `the yearly sum to each of the funds of §§19–21` TIMES 4 EQUALS 4000000

-- not weighed against `the Sick Pay Law`: §21 renews the sick-days fund
-- and funds it; the grants it pays are §§4–19 of the agreement of
-- 25.6.1995, which is outside the corpus. The renewal of 10.9.2003, which
-- the corpus holds, is weighed in its own file: the fund pays only after
-- the accrued sick days are used, when the law has nothing left to give.
-- §21 itself rules nothing on sick pay.

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `action of 14.3.2018`
DECIDE `paying a fund of §§19–21 in` y IS
    IF elem y `the years of §§19–21`
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `transfer the yearly sum to the union's fund`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- §22: from 2018 a million shekels is added for good to the base sum of the
-- union's fund for professional development (קרן ידע), updated each year
-- as the base is; from 2019 another million, so the base rises by 2
-- million against its value on the eve of the agreement. The base itself
-- is an input.
@ref akn:art_22/p1 akn:art_22/p2
GIVEN `the base sum on the eve of 14.3.2018, as updated` IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the knowledge fund's base under §22` `the base sum on the eve of 14.3.2018, as updated` y IS
    BRANCH IF y AT LEAST 2019 THEN `the base sum on the eve of 14.3.2018, as updated` PLUS 2000000
           IF y AT LEAST 2018 THEN `the base sum on the eve of 14.3.2018, as updated` PLUS 1000000
           OTHERWISE `the base sum on the eve of 14.3.2018, as updated`

§§ `23 הסכם 26.6.2014`

-- §23: unlike its own §§8(א) and 11(א), §§8 and 11 of the agreement of
-- 26.6.2014 did not lapse on 31.8.2017 and go on applying.
@ref akn:art_23/p1
`§§8 and 11 of 26.6.2014 lapsed on 31.8.2017` MEANS FALSE

§§ `24 החזר ימי לימודים בשל השביתה`

-- (א): following the director-general's notice on making up the high
-- schools' school days and hours lost to the strike — its date left blank
-- (F-oz-2018-a) — the teachers make them up as it sets out. (ב): only those
-- employed by its rules and the Ministry's guidelines are paid as it says.
-- (ג): they are paid an advance with the salary of April 2018 (paid in May),
-- deducted as the notice directs. The notice is outside the corpus: what
-- it sets is an input.
@ref akn:art_24__para_a akn:art_24__para_b akn:art_24__para_c
`the day §24 prints for the director-general's notice` MEANS "________"

`§24 names the notice by a blank date` MEANS
    `the day §24 prints for the director-general's notice` EQUALS "________"
#ASSERT `§24 names the notice by a blank date`

GIVEN `employed by the notice's rules and the Ministry's guidelines` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `action of 14.3.2018`
DECIDE `making up the strike days of 14.3.2018` `employed by the notice's rules and the Ministry's guidelines` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `make up the school days the strike lost`

`the salary month §24's advance is paid with` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2018

§§ `25 סכסוכי עבודה`

-- §25: every labour dispute ארגון המורים declared up to the signing is void.
@ref akn:art_25/p1
`the union's labour disputes stand after 14.3.2018` MEANS FALSE

§§ `26 מיצוי תביעות`

-- (א): the agreement exhausts what it settles; (ב): and every claim for
-- economic demands that would raise the cost of employing the teachers, or
-- for further benefits, for the period to 28.2.2022 — no further wage or
-- benefit negotiation for it; (ג): this takes nothing from the merger
-- agreement's exhaustion clauses.
@ref akn:art_26__para_a akn:art_26__para_b akn:art_26__para_c
`the period the agreement of 14.3.2018 exhausts ends on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 28 2 2022

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `action of 14.3.2018`
DECIDE `no further economic demands of 14.3.2018 on` d IS
    IF d `is on or before` `the period the agreement of 14.3.2018 exhausts ends on`
    THEN PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
         SHANT `negotiate further economic demands to 28.2.2022`
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `27 שקט תעשייתי`

-- ¶1: to 28.2.2022 no strike, lockout or organised disruption over what the
-- agreement settles; ¶2: this takes nothing from the merger agreement's
-- industrial peace.
@ref akn:art_27/p1 akn:art_27/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `action of 14.3.2018`
DECIDE `industrial peace of 14.3.2018 on` d IS
    IF d `is on or before` `the period the agreement of 14.3.2018 exhausts ends on`
    THEN PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
         SHANT `strike, lock out or disrupt work over what the agreement of 14.3.2018 settles`
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `28 הסדר שלם ותנאים קודמים`

-- ¶1: the provisions §11 names are one whole arrangement for the merger of
-- components, bound together, none applied without the others. ¶2: earlier
-- terms stand unless amended or cancelled, expressly or by implication.
-- ¶4: nothing here, the scope clause and what was done for the high
-- schools among it, is consent to a separate bargaining unit in post-primary
-- education (grades 10–14), nor a waiver of any claim on the union's
-- representation there.
@ref akn:art_28/p1 akn:art_28/p2 akn:art_28/p4
`a provision §11 of 14.3.2018 names applies without the others` MEANS FALSE
`earlier terms stand after 14.3.2018 unless amended` MEANS TRUE
`the agreement of 14.3.2018 consents to a separate bargaining unit` MEANS FALSE

-- akn:conclusions/t1 The signatures of the three employers and ארגון המורים; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 A file number (2017-53950); no rule.

