-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p1 The signatures under annex ד'; no rule.

-- Which annex a table of the circular names is (`the reform table in force`
-- and its like name them, their figures an input there): the rows here.
GIVEN a IS A `combined-salary table`
GIVETH A LIST OF `row of the Oz tables of 14.3.2018`
DECIDE `the rows of the annex of 14.3.2018` a IS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `the tables before this agreement` THEN EMPTY
    WHEN `annex A, reform, from 1.9.2017` THEN `the rows of annex א' of 14.3.2018`
    WHEN `annex B, reform, from 1.9.2018` THEN `the rows of annex ב' of 14.3.2018`
    WHEN `annex C, reform, from 1.12.2018` THEN `the rows of annex ג' of 14.3.2018`
    WHEN `annex D, outside the reform and principals, from 1.9.2018` THEN `the rows of annex ד' of 14.3.2018`

GIVEN `the rows` IS A LIST OF `row of the Oz tables of 14.3.2018`
      y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `row of the Oz tables of 14.3.2018`
DECIDE `the row for a year of seniority, 14.3.2018` `the rows` y IS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `its seniority, 14.3.2018` EQUALS y) `the rows`
    WHEN r FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST r
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING

#ASSERT count (`the rows of annex א' of 14.3.2018`) EQUALS 36
#ASSERT count (`the rows of annex ד' of 14.3.2018`) EQUALS 36
#ASSERT CONSIDER `the row for a year of seniority, 14.3.2018` (`the rows of the annex of 14.3.2018` `annex A, reform, from 1.9.2017`) 1
        WHEN JUST r THEN r's `a doctorate, 14.3.2018` EQUALS 3978.57
        WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
#ASSERT CONSIDER `the row for a year of seniority, 14.3.2018` (`the rows of the annex of 14.3.2018` `annex D, outside the reform and principals, from 1.9.2018`) 36
        WHEN JUST r THEN r's `a certified teacher, 14.3.2018` EQUALS 5519.79
        WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
